  "description": "Grayling Property Management are delighted to present this beautiful, cozy studio apartment. (20 Sqm) \n\nThis apartment comprises a modern kitchen, living/dining area and separate bed space. The bathroom is fitted with a power shower. \n\nThe apartment is ideally within short walking distance to the city centre and numerous bus routes servicing all parts of the city pass the front door while the nearest LUAS ( Harcourt ) is just 4 minutes walk away The apartment is located within a short walk from Grafton Street and St. Stephen's Green, one of Dublin's busiest shopping districts. \n\nViewing is essential to appreciate this fine property.",
